Findings that change the plan:

- The plan grep `image\.file` misses `storytime-loops-content.test.ts` (it reads `image?.file`). That file must change in the Maker commit, because `withoutNewFields` does not drop `focus.family.words[].image.file`. The new pattern is in plan_updates P3.
- The parity test of H5 compares the card element only. A mutant in `STORYTIME_CARD_COLOR_PATCH` changes both sides, and the page CSS is private to the card kit. So Red 1 needs a hand-written hex table, pixel tests, and a render-level dot count (R1-8, R1-10).
- `friend` has no entry in `card-pictures.json`. `family` has an entry but no file in the card MANIFEST. Both fall to Forge by H3.
- A bare `family/` match finds the book folder `w04/books/1-my-family/`. All path rules anchor on `/family/`.
- The spec leaves some names open (script options, check export, error text, `--check` line form). Decisions S8 to S12 pin defaults.

Baseline (no new full run): the loops Phase 3b Green 1 run, capture `measure/runs/storytime_teaching_loops_20261103/jr-green-p3b-96659ea3-project.txt`, at HEAD `96659ea3` plus the uncommitted loops Green 1 edits, with the loops window open: exit 1, 59 files, 1254 tests, 1 failed (a 5 s timeout in `storytime-print-weeks-2-8.test.ts`, passes alone on rerun). Older run at `0e632495`: 58 files, 1230 tests, 7 failed.

